  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve community level public health facilities by strenghtening community voices to demand better public health facilities and linking those voices to national level policy advocacy in Bangladesh and Nepal. The project builds upon a participatory approach using community radios and community broadcasters as a means to foster advocacy.  Participating countries: Nepal and Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
